{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/steam_desc_title2.png?t=1743718739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/gameplay_demo.gif?t=1743718739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you discover powerful equipment in the Unknown Lands, it will become available to you going forward. Mix and match equipment to find the playstyle that perfectly suits you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/steam_desc_title1.png?t=1743718739\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/map_demo.gif?t=1743718739\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Unknown Lands are vast, with many secret passages, hidden relics, and strange sights. Each run will unravel the world more and more, giving you a chance to make new discoveries each time.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/steam_desc_title3.png?t=1743718739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/extras/rune_demo.gif?t=1743718739\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run you make into the Unknown Lands will yield many powerful Runes. Use these to radically change and empower your equipment, making each run a unique experience.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3219180?t=1743718739","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743718739","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219180/3232fe15943c41c8377fe8f7b89de9cc3f6259ce/c